    "Content": [
        ["", "problems/TXG3R/media/S3a.jpg"],
        [" ", "My baseball glove went missing,"],
        [" ", "So, I looked everywhere —"],
        [" ", "In drawers and laundry baskets"],
        [" ", "And under every chair.\n\n"],
        ["5", "The leather of my old glove"],
        [" ", "Was butter-soft and worn,"],
        [" ", "But showing age in places,"],
        [" ", "The thumb seam slightly torn.\n\n"],
        [" ", "And when I couldn’t find it,"],
        ["10", "It left me feeling sad"],
        [" ", "For my much-beloved treasure —"],
        [" ", "The best glove I’ve ever had.\n\n"],
        [" ", "My brother lent his old glove"],
        [" ", "For catch with my friend John,"],
        ["15", "And where I `text(once)` had talent,"],
        [" ", "Those skills seemed to be gone.\n\n"],
        [" ", "My fingertips could not reach"],
        [" ", "To the ends of that mitt."],
        [" ", "`text(Each ball)` that John chucked my way"],
        ["20", "Bounced off the end of it.\n\n"],
        [" ", "I guess I could get better"],
        [" ", "By practicing some more,"],
        [" ", "But playing catch now isn’t like"],
        [" ", "The way it was before.\n\n"],
        ["25", "I’ll keep using this `ultext(imitation)`,"],
        [" ", "If I can’t find my real glove,"],
        [" ", "And hope that I grow into"],
        [" ", "A new mitt I can love."]
